 best move from the Valid Moves list above. You can choose to pass even if you have valid moves that can beat the previous play, but you cannot pass if you are in a Free Play (no last play).\nEnsure your response matches one of the valid moves exactly.\nRemember to provide Explanation, Reason, and Answer.", 'reasoning': '', 'output': 'Evaluation:  \n- Play BlackJoker: Beats ♥A and likely wins the trick, but it’s your only card, so you go out immediately.  \n- Pass: Keeps the card, but gives up the chance to finish; also risks opponents gaining tempo.\n\nReason: Playing BlackJoker ends your hand right now, guaranteeing you empty your cards before either peasant.\n\nAnswer: {"cards":["BlackJoker"]}'}
